==Trivia==
===Origin===
{{main|Pokémon world in relation to the real world#Johto|Pokémon world in relation to the real world → Johto}}
Ruins of Alph may correspond to the {{wp|Ishibutai Kofun}} and {{wp|Takamatsuzuka Tomb}} burial mounds located in the village of {{wp|Asuka, Nara|Asuka}} in the {{wp|Nara Prefecture}}, both of which are designated as {{wp|Monuments of Japan|National Historic Site of Japan}}.

